data.value:
 `null`/missing names.

Fix in `packages/shared/src/format.js`:

```js
export function displayName(user) {
  const name = user?.name;
  if (typeof name !== "string") return "anonymous";
  const trimmed = name.trim();
  return trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : "anonymous";
}
```

It now returns `"anonymous"` for `null`, `{}`, non-string names, and empty/whitespace names, while preserving trimming for valid names. The other two failures (`cli-flag`, `timezone`) are separate intentional failures in this repo.

